WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
“The Emperor of Ice-Cream”

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.910
Wallace Stevens

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.019
Call the roller of big cigars,
The muscular one, and bid him whip

00:00:11.019 --> 00:00:17.080
In kitchen cups concupiscent curds.
Let the wenches dawdle in such dress

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:24.080
As they are used to wear, and let the boys
Bring flowers in last month’s newspapers.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:31.320
Let be be finale of seem.
The only emperor is the emperor of ice-cream.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:37.579
Take from the dresser of deal,
Lacking the three glass knobs, that sheet

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:44.579
On which she embroidered fantails once
And spread it so as to cover her face.

00:00:44.719 --> 00:00:51.510
If her horny feet protrude, they come
To show how cold she is, and dumb.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:57.910
Let the lamp affix its beam.
The only emperor is the emperor of ice-cream.

